### ============================
### 📦 INVENTORY
### ============================

### GET all inventory
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/inventory

### GET inventory by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/inventory/6c5d1151-aa4a-401c-83aa-f43d20705ee9

### CREATE inventory
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_name": "Tepung Terigu",
  "description": "Bahan dasar roti",
  "category": "Bahan Baku",
  "unit_type": "kg",
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001"
}

### UPDATE inventory
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/inventory/6c5d1151-aa4a-401c-83aa-f43d20705ee9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_name": "Tepung Terigu Segitiga Biru (Updated)",
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE inventory
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/inventory/:inventoryId

---

### ============================
### 📥 INPUT HISTORY
### ============================

### GET all input history
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/input-history

### GET input history by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/input-history/:historyId

### CREATE input history
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/input-history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": "0860f186-c938-403f-9607-5efe3300970e",
  "inventory_id": "6c5d1151-aa4a-401c-83aa-f43d20705ee9",
  "shipping_fee": 10000,
  "price": 20000,
  "total_stock": 100,
  "current_stock": 100,
  "input_datetime": "2025-05-14T08:00:00.000Z",
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001"
}

### UPDATE input history
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/input-history/1a71adeb-4ed2-4523-920e-8574c0a6c07e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_stock": 200,
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE input history
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/input-history/:historyId

---

### ============================
### 🚚 SUPPLIER
### ============================

### GET all suppliers
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/supplier

### GET supplier by ID
GET http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/supplier/0860f186-c938-403f-9607-5efe3300970e

### CREATE supplier
POST http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/supplier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PT Sumber Pangan",
  "description": "Distributor tepung dan gula",
  "address": "Jl. Cendrawasih No.88",
  "phone_number": "+628123456789",
  "Status": true,
  "created_by": "admin",
  "updated_by": "admin",
  "owned_by": "tenant-001"
}

### UPDATE supplier
PUT http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/supplier/0860f186-c938-403f-9607-5efe3300970e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Jl. Cendrawasih No.99 (Updated)",
  "updated_by": "admin"
}

### DELETE supplier (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:9990/api/v1/inventory/supplier/:supplierId
